---
---

<section class="section section--deep roi" id="roi" data-cordeau-snap>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="roi__head" data-reveal="up">
      <p class="eyebrow">Le retour sur investissement</p>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:0.75rem; max-width: 30ch;">
        Il suffit d'<span class="roi__accent">un seul devis sauvé</span> pour rentabiliser votre implémentation.
      </h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">
        Le reste, c'est du bénéfice pur. En général, ChantierPilot se rentabilise en
        <strong style="color:var(--creme)">1 à 2 mois</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="roi__panel" data-reveal="scale">
      <div class="roi__simulator" data-simulator>
        <div class="roi__slider-row">
          <label for="devisSlider" class="roi__slider-label">
            Combien de devis envoyez-vous par mois ?
          </label>
          <div class="roi__slider-value">
            <span data-sim-devis>10</span> devis / mois
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="roi__slider-track">
          <div class="roi__slider-fill" data-sim-fill aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <input
            type="range"
            id="devisSlider"
            data-sim-slider
            min="2"
            max="40"
            step="1"
            value="10"
            aria-describedby="roiResult"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="roi__result" id="roiResult">
          <div class="roi__result-figure">
            <span class="roi__currency">≈</span>
            <span class="roi__result-number" data-sim-recovered>2 291</span>
            <span class="roi__currency">€</span>
            <span class="roi__result-suffix">récupérés / mois</span>
          </div>
          <p class="roi__result-note">
            Estimation basée sur une valeur moyenne de devis BTP et un taux de conversion réaliste
            grâce à la relance automatique. Vos chiffres réels dépendent de votre métier — on les
            affine ensemble en démo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="roi__counter-block">
        <p class="roi__counter-label">Sur une année, pour 10 devis/mois</p>
        <div class="roi__counter">
          <span class="roi__counter-num" data-counter="38280" data-counter-suffix=" €"></span>
        </div>
        <p class="roi__counter-sub">C'est le chiffre d'affaires qu'un artisan laisse dormir — et que ChantierPilot rattrape seul.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .roi__accent {
    color: var(--or-clair);
  }

  .roi__panel {
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: rgba(163, 133, 96, 0.28);
    border: 1px solid rgba(163, 133, 96, 0.28);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .roi__simulator,
  .roi__counter-block {
    background: var(--sapin-profond);
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .roi__slider-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .roi__slider-label {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.75);
    max-width: 26ch;
  }

  .roi__slider-value {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--or-clair);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .roi__slider-track {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.12);
  }

  .roi__slider-fill {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 20%;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--or), var(--or-clair));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  input[data-sim-slider] {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -10px 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 26px;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  input[data-sim-slider]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--or-clair);
    border: 3px solid var(--sapin-profond);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(201, 168, 118, 0.6);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  input[data-sim-slider]::-moz-range-thumb {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--or-clair);
    border: 3px solid var(--sapin-profond);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(201, 168, 118, 0.6);
  }

  input[data-sim-slider]:focus-visible::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    outline: 2px solid var(--creme);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .roi__result {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(163, 133, 96, 0.35);
  }

  .roi__result-figure {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--creme);
  }

  .roi__currency {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--or-clair);
  }

  .roi__result-number {
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    color: var(--or-clair);
  }

  .roi__result-suffix {
    font-family: var(--f-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.65);
    margin-left: 0.3rem;
  }

  .roi__result-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.5);
    max-width: 48ch;
  }

  .roi__counter-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .roi__counter-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.55);
  }

  .roi__counter {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .roi__counter-num {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
    color: var(--creme);
  }

  .roi__counter-sub {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(236, 230, 219, 0.6);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .roi__panel {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
